===== INTERPRETATION AND LIMITATIONS =====
This is a matched, conditional descriptive comparison, not a causal estimate.
Greedy nearest-pair matching is without replacement, not globally optimal.
Maximum standardized Euclidean distance: 2.00; six equally weighted dimensions.
No relaxed calipers, replacement, or backfilling were used.
Matched sample requires complete uninterrupted follow-up through 12H.
Controls are not removed if they later break out; that incidence is reported.
No trading simulation, fees, slippage, funding, fills, or profitability inference.
Thresholds are full-sample retrospective quantiles, not live-calibrated.
Volume analysis not run because source volume units remain unverified.
Read-only: source CSVs and research scripts were not modified; no files written.
